","current_statement_sha256":"sha256:bc669083c095356ea201da632934146bb08ad323f3a313801c57422ec9d29e90","file":"preprints/An-Irrational-Trace-Counterexample-to-Reduced-Baum-Connes-September-23-2026/build/introduction.tex","line":57,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"ec610f5c7c3cd2a26201ebf50cdaaba1c948791db8f896513d68fe624bdfb4bd","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/An-Irrational-Trace-Counterexample-to-Reduced-Baum-Connes-September-23-2026/build/introduction.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:bc669083c095356ea201da632934146bb08ad323f3a313801c57422ec9d29e90","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/An-Irrational-Trace-Counterexample-to-Reduced-Baum-Connes-September-23-2026/build/introduction.tex#L57"},"statement_kind":"theorem","text":"\\label{thm:main}\nThere exist a finitely generated discrete group \\(\\Gsur\\) and a projection\n\\(b_0\\in C_r^*(\\Gsur)\\) with irrational canonical trace. Moreover,\n\\[\n[b_0]\\notin\\mu_0^{\\Gsur}\\bigl(K_0^{\\Gsur}(\\underline E\\Gsur)\\bigr).\n\\]\nIn particular, the coefficient-free reduced Baum--Connes conjecture for\ncountable discrete groups is false."}
